WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.990 line:90%,end
That night, everyone gathered in Doctor Ekin's core for one last plan.

2
00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:10.100 line:90%,end
To wake the remaining eleven capsules, we need the crystal piece.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.950 line:90%,end
Or something stronger.

4
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.890 line:90%,end
Something stronger?

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.990 line:90%,end
Hearts that beat together.

6
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:21.270 line:90%,end
If you all touch the crystal at the same time, it may be enough even without the piece.

7
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.500 line:90%,end
So we're all going to hold hands?

8
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.640 line:90%,end
Fine, but Mira's hands are ice cold, I'm warning you now.

9
00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:32.030 line:90%,end
Say one more word and I'll freeze your ears.

10
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.310 line:90%,end
Everyone laughed.

11
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.860 line:90%,end
Then twelve people joined hands around the crystal heart.

12
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:46.400 line:90%,end
AyShe, Eray, Aslı, Mira, Leon, Mony, Anka, Nyra, Kael and the three newly awakened.

13
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.940 line:90%,end
Pusula floated in the middle. Her light was brighter than ever.

14
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.970 line:90%,end
Heartbeats are synchronizing.

15
00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.160 line:90%,end
Fifty percent. Eighty percent. One hundred percent!

16
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:02.020 line:90%,end
Blue light rose from the crystal heart and flowed into the hall beneath the castle.

17
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.750 line:90%,end
Nine, ten, thirteen, fourteen...

18
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.920 line:90%,end
One by one, all the capsules opened.

19
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:12.140 line:90%,end
And for the first time, all twenty-three of the twenty-three capsules were awake.

20
00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:17.230 line:90%,end
I have waited three hundred years for this moment. All of humanity, together again.

21
00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:21.060 line:90%,end
Look! The ones who woke up are smiling. They recognize us.

22
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:24.460 line:90%,end
The hall filled with laughter and hugs.

23
00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.860 line:90%,end
Sergeant rubbed against everyone's legs, one by one.

24
00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.860 line:90%,end
Sergeant, you count as the twenty-fourth capsule now.

25
00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:36.980 line:90%,end
But the celebration was short. All the castle walls turned red.

26
00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.400 line:90%,end
Twenty-three awake, huh? Good.

27
00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:43.030 line:90%,end
All of you in one place. Just the way I wanted.

28
00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:47.350 line:90%,end
Sila had begun marching her whole robot army toward the castle.

